a","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T19:47:59Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T19:47:59Z","body":"> and see how big the generated library is?\n\nAbout 2 MB, definitely nowhere near proper size, macOS template executable should be about 100 MB.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3429274970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3429336197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111876#issuecomment-3429336197","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111876","id":3429336197,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MZ4SF","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T19:55:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T19:55:01Z","body":"Adding the same `libtool` call result in more reasonable 380 MB library:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/platform/macos/SCsub b/platform/macos/SCsub\nindex 30bf5c6f38..b83ec9daaf 100644\n--- a/platform/macos/SCsub\n+++ b/platform/macos/SCsub\n@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@\n from misc.utility.scons_hints import *\n \n import platform_macos_builders\n+from platform_methods import combine_libs_apple_embedded\n \n Import(\"env\")\n \n@@ -44,7 +45,10 @@ else:\n     files += [\"libgodot_macos.mm\"]\n \n if env[\"library_type\"] == \"static_library\":\n-    prog = env.add_library(\"#bin/godot\", files)\n+    macos_lib = env.add_library(\"macos\", files)\n+    prog = env.CommandNoCache(\n+        \"#bin/libgodot\" + env[\"LIBSUFFIX\"], [macos_lib] + env[\"LIBS\"], env.Run(combine_libs_apple_embedded)\n+    )\n elif env[\"library_type\"] == \"shared_library\":\n     prog = env.add_shared_library(\"#bin/godot\", files)\n else:\ndiff --git a/platform/macos/detect.py b/platform/macos/detect.py\nindex cfedad0970..37f185f6ce 100644\n--- a/platform/macos/detect.py\n+++ b/platform/macos/detect.py\n@@ -241,7 +241,8 @@ def configure(env: \"SConsEnvironment\"):\n             \"IOSurface\",\n         ]\n     )\n-    env.Append(LIBS=[\"pthread\", \"z\"])\n+    if env[\"library_type\"] != \"static_library\":\n+        env.Append(LIBS=[\"pthread\", \"z\"])\n \n     extra_frameworks = set()\n \n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3429336197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3429378676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111876#issuecomment-3429378676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111876","id":3429378676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MaCp0","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T20:05:49Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T20:05:49Z","body":"Also, `libgodot_macos.mm` init code looks broken, so macOS library is likely non-functional in any case.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3429378676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"